  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_skgoat",
      "name": {
        "en": "Earthspirit's Badge",
        "zh": "地灵证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Earthspirit has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for impeding the enemy.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Supporter Operator during field operations to exercise Decel Binder responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员地灵擅长牵制敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为辅助干员，行使凝滞师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_skgoat",
      "name": {
        "en": "Application Forms, To Be Confirmed",
        "zh": "待确认的申请表",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_skgoat",
      "description": {
        "en": "TO BE EXPENSED: Repairs + installing a music player on motorcycle\nJUSTIFICATION: Motorcycle broke down. Also, would very much like approval for adding a music player.\nOVERVIEW FROM ENGINEERING DEPT.: Fernand II 3-wheel motorcycle, manufactured before Battle of the Four Emperors, antique. Mr. Greypaw conducted fullbody inspection, says original parts hard to find because of age. Re safety: vehicle as old as this should be in museum, not speeding on roads. Greypaw explained this to Earthspirit, Earthspirit stated vehicle originally belonged to mentor Prof. Bachmann. Earthspirit oft. sat in sidecar holding boxes of stones, following mentor everywhere on field investigations. Prof. Bachmann gifted vehicle to her at graduation, and asked her to keep a promise. At present, Prof. Bachmann is deceased. Left only this Fernand II behind, always reminding Earthspirit not to forget promise. Earthspirit rides this motorcycle on vacation, sidecar usually filled with various stones when she returns, plus other Catastrophe Messengers hitchhike on occasion.\nVIEW OF ENGINEERING DEPT.: Given special nature of Earthspirit's dept. plus direct superior of that dept. being the Doctor, this form to be passed onto the Doctor.\n\nTO BE EXPENSED: Installation of suppressor for tuning fork\nJUSTIFICATION: Sound has been bothering people more lately. Seemingly caused by Oripathy? Require installing an inhibitor for my tuning fork.\nOVERVIEW FROM MEDICAL DEPT.: While true Earthspirit's Oripathy has grown severe, no others have heard this supposed sound she mentions. According to physical examination results, the worsening of Earthspirit's Oripathy seems to relate to her continued involuntary continuous usage of Originium Arts.\nOVERVIEW FROM ENGINEERING DEPT.: Tuning fork is Leithanian, custom-order by Earthspirit's mentor for Earthspirit. Rhodes Island requires relevant tech documentation before able to commence investigation of how to limit its output rate.\nVIEW OF ENGINEERING DEPT.: Given special nature of Earthspirit's dept. plus direct superior of that dept. being the Doctor, this form to be passed onto the Doctor.\n\nLEAVE REQUESTED: Visiting home\nLEAVE PERIOD: Apr 1 TO Apr 8\nDATE OF REQUEST: Feb 24\nAPPLICANT: Glacier Wegenie\nDETAILS: Haven't returned home in a long time. I would like to visit, given relative proximity to Leithanien soon.\nVIEW OF HR DEPT.: Approved. Earthspirit was attacked by unknown assailants during a recent field mission, and is presently being treated in the Medical cabin. No adjustment of leave period required, as reconfirmed with Earthspirit. Additionally, Provence + Eyjafjalla will travel with Earthspirit, though given Provence has not returned aboard recently, we provisionally have not received her leave request.\n*Given special nature of Earthspirit's dept. plus direct superior of that dept. being the Doctor, this form to be passed onto the Doctor.",
        "zh": "报销内容：修复，并给摩托车装一台车载音乐播放器\n说明：摩托车坏了。另外，想加装一台车载音乐播放器，望批准。\n工程部综述：费尔南德二代偏三轮摩托，产于四皇会战前，是辆老古董。负责整体车况检查的灰掌大哥说，由于年代久远，原厂件难寻。从安全性而言，这样的老车也该进入博物馆，而不是在路上飞驰。灰掌向地灵说明上述情况后，地灵表示该车辆原本属于她的老师巴赫曼教授。大学时，地灵常怀抱装有石头的盒子，坐在边斗内，随自己的老师到处进行田野调查。毕业时，巴赫曼教授将这辆车赠予她，并要求她遵守一个约定。而今，巴赫曼教授已逝，唯余这辆费尔南德二代，时刻提醒着地灵勿忘约定。地灵在假期也会驾驶这辆摩托车外出，归来时边斗内通常装着各种石头，偶尔也有其他天灾信使搭便车。\n工程部意见：由于地灵所在部门的特殊性，其直属上司为博士，本文件将转交博士。\n\n报销内容：为音叉安装抑制器\n说明：似乎是矿石病的原因？那些声音最近更扰人了。需要为我的音叉安装抑制器。\n医疗部综述：地灵的矿石病在变严重这件事属实，但没有其他人听到她口中所谓的声音。根据体检结果，地灵矿石病的恶化似乎与其仍在非主动不间断地使用源石技艺有关。\n工程部综述：该音叉是地灵的老师为她在莱塔尼亚特别定制的产品，罗德岛需要相关的技术说明，才能着手研究如何限制其输出功率。\n工程部意见：由于地灵所在部门的特殊性，其直属上司为博士，本文件将转交博士。\n\n请假申请：回家\n请假时间：4月1日至4月8日\n申请时间：2月24日\n申请人：格拉西艾尔·魏格妮\n内容：很久没回家了，趁着离莱塔尼亚较近，我想回家看看。\n人事部意见：批准。地灵最近在外勤任务中受到不明人员袭击，目前正在医疗舱治疗。已与地灵再次确认，请假时间无需调整。另外，普罗旺斯、艾雅法拉会与地灵同行，但由于普罗旺斯近期没有回舰，暂未收到她的请假申请。\n*由于地灵所在部门的特殊性，其直属上司为博士，本文件将转交博士。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
